### ==========================================
### ✅ EXPECTED RESULTS
### ==========================================
###
### ✅ Similar Products:
### - similarity_score > 0.5 (50%+)
### - Same or related category
### - Similar price range
### - computation_time_ms < 200ms (indexed)
### - computation_time_ms < 800ms (on-the-fly)
###
### ✅ Bundle Recommendations:
### - Products NOT in input bundle
### - Complementary products (different category)
### - similarity_score to centroid > 0.5
### - computation_time_ms < 500ms
###
### ✅ Caching:
### - First call: from_cache = false
### - Second call: from_cache = true
### - Response time < 10ms for cache hit
###
### ✅ Error Handling:
### - 404: Product not found
### - 400: Invalid input format
### - 503: ML service unavailable
### - Fallback strategies active
###
### ==========================================
